---
// Gives editors a useful preview destination when a saved draft has no valid public route yet.
import SiteDocument from '../layouts/SiteDocument.astro';
---

<SiteDocument pathname="/preview-unavailable/" title="Preview unavailable" noIndex>
  <main>
    <h1>Preview unavailable for this draft</h1>
    <p>The draft is saved, but the website cannot build its preview URL until its route fields are complete.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Blog posts, conditions and providers need a valid slug.</li>
      <li>Clinics need a slug or clinic name.</li>
      <li>Service updates need a valid date and slug.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Complete the route fields, save the draft, then reopen Preview.</p>
  </main>
</SiteDocument>
